# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF. Codex cloud runs on Linux and
# the vault is edited on Windows; without this every file flips between CRLF and
# LF and shows as modified. Run once after adding this file:
#   git add --renormalize . && git commit -m "Normalise line endings"
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
